{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ed0f26cfd2322a3c7ab7295ec7183afa2e29ce3d69e2be7574f5c69a64f36b77", "ja": "美也、お疲れさま。\nその衣装、よく似合ってるじゃないか。", "zh": "美也，辛苦了。\n那套服装很适合你哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0084_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "cb4c04794eb434bbf00d87c985c865d6ddf073e30d40efbf2ae0d8c915aa9ac8", "ja": "お～、{$P$}さん。\nありがとうございます～。", "zh": "喔～{$P$}先生，\n谢谢你～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0084_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "68c6f18e29c0ff984f1679d33c207353c7525544d072df88318950a7217b60ca", "ja": "猫役と聞いてたので、どんな衣装になるのかな～と\n思ってましたけど。とってもかわいいですね～。", "zh": "听说要演猫，很好奇会是怎样的服装～\n真的非常可爱呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0084_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "6c04aaa8976db53d2c55eab8e6a81cc9e3bfd5f5acba7d526989883421ea306b", "ja": "これなら、こぶんちゃんみたいな猫さんに\nなれそうですよ～。", "zh": "穿上这套服装以后，\n我应该能变成像小弟那样的猫咪喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0084_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c1b99df2a9546d112ff81305b95a15983358071a23a63e2348410a8fcef85ace", "ja": "うん、美也のイメージにピッタリで、かわいいな。\nファンのみんなにも好評みたいだし……。", "zh": "嗯，非常符合美也的形象，很可爱呢。\n粉丝们看了也非常喜欢的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0084_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "8395cb53d2c661e46ddad0de8d55b98486b4d5ef55f4099c22cafdac529e0970", "ja": "お～、そうでしたか～。\nなんだか照れますな～、ふふふ。", "zh": "喔～原来是这样啊～\n感觉有点害羞呢～呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0084_1006_p", "source_sha256": "06ffbddc6b5f945dd2174a9855c57e12fc2bc67afaf7d7e0359e2f975ec0a71c", "ja": "それだけ、ファンの人達の映画への期待も\n高まってるって事かな！", "zh": "而且，这也就表示\n粉丝越来越期待电影的上映了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0084_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "0cdf772a7997b11a8519b9b9c6296b579a9c262917bc63ff6bac5d018ae11b61", "ja": "そうですね～。\nたくさんの人に見てもらいたいです～。", "zh": "对呀～\n希望能让许多人看到～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0084_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "a571a94982e513e122535dc3ecaa00102c174c01962605cd6f077d9a5d16f317", "ja": "ところで、{$P$}さん。\nスリーサイズを教えてくれますか～？", "zh": "话说{$P$}先生，\n可以把你的三围告诉我吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0084_1009_p", "source_sha256": "90bfa277d9bff1202c5217a6284036ca142f304f9e7510fcbf11e4be66b89733", "ja": "え？　スリーサイズ？", "zh": "咦？三围？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0084_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "506c3fb2b55b3a28f5d41ee02f928989ce0d084c8971a142cd7f069b8f3a4700", "ja": "はい～。\nスリーサイズがわからないと、衣装が作れないので～。", "zh": "是的～\n不知道三围的话，我没有办法做服装～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0084_1011_p", "source_sha256": "61b99897a2e227669a665accb1773f472448380ee5ccfa467a65751e70fe8735", "ja": "衣装って、何の？", "zh": "你说服装，要做什么用的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0084_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "95e22f85a033223fb4fa6ea0880b09768d4da475812c6e239207430fb8d69778", "ja": "もちろん、{$P$}さんのですよ～。\n美咲さんに教えてもらって、作ってみようかと～。", "zh": "当然是要给{$P$}先生穿啊～\n我想去请教美咲，试着自己做做看～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0084_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "5cbe9dabd9753fa09cff6dfe0492b6b9c0575a626cf04a48db6759c26182f839", "ja": "私、この衣装がもらえたとき、\nなんだかとってもうれしかったんです～。", "zh": "我收到这套服装的时候，\n真的非常高兴～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0084_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "2965f313cac7f9bd4e14bfdf544bddcd1f0a8ea8efce8ac601d7427124c83601", "ja": "なので{$P$}さんにも、\nその気持ちを、わけてあげたいと思いまして～。", "zh": "所以我想把这份感动，\n也跟{$P$}先生分享～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0084_1015_p", "source_sha256": "065b88c34e439f367bd17e73f2b27f58f77c5120ff3f9c99251fae2b48e9f0b6", "ja": "そうか……美也の気持ちはありがたいけど、\nそれなら衣装じゃなくて、映画で返してほしいかな。", "zh": "这样啊……我很谢谢美也有这份心，\n但希望你是用电影，而不是用服装来跟我分享。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0084_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "3839ee8c9e2c934397760c7f6f7a54e0da1e82719b8f58ceade68ab73c84eacc", "ja": "映画で、ですか～？", "zh": "你是说用电影吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0084_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e34efb762290f0bfd5af4eed7ff5d5bb04212b7cbce9ead5b34a23c74256dd85", "ja": "うん。美也がその衣装で演技をしているところを\n見られるのが、一番うれしい。", "zh": "嗯，看到美也穿着那套服装发挥演技，\n就是我最高兴的事了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0084_1018_p", "source_sha256": "aa5d371822ba59fa368101b58bc86e1ced9f183a2440203248e5dbbbcf87ca01", "ja": "きっとファンの人達も、同じだと思う。", "zh": "粉丝们一定也是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0084_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "4dd6cafe4303d43fb84a6171da588daf56aa759de8d3fef6766d6fa91a8fc4d3", "ja": "お～、そうでしたか～。それなら大丈夫ですよ～。\n今の私は、やる気に満ちていますからね～。", "zh": "喔～原来是这样～这样的话你不用担心～\n我现在可是有满满的干劲呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0084_1020_042miy", "source_sha256": "420d9cabb87ea13c62a63eba026b66a790a66ff775f189703a53cdaf49924e48", "ja": "必ず{$P$}さんや、ファンのみんなに\n楽しんでもらえる、素敵な映画にしてみせます～。", "zh": "我们一定会完成很棒的电影，\n让{$P$}先生和粉丝们都能享受的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0084_1021_p", "source_sha256": "bf99278e11e831a3b5c7c0d5c0b001242a51ad586e01d617f2ec094ebd6b3dca", "ja": "ああ、期待してるよ！\nお客さん、たくさん観に来てくれるといいな。", "zh": "嗯，我很期待喔！\n希望到时候会有很多观众。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0084_1022_042miy", "source_sha256": "3bfa30faded9d9b8e9adf43ead229d2ea9c3c038917a9c10d41f2e8fd6e671ed", "ja": "はい～。\nがんばりますね～。", "zh": "好～\n我会加油的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0084_1023_p", "source_sha256": "176d1123abbaa701f3635262203a32e871f6d24707d944a9a315c4764a460adf", "ja": "（鶴の恩返しならぬ、美也の恩返しか。\nうん、期待して待っていようかな）", "zh": "（这不是白鹤报恩，而是美也报恩呀。\n嗯，我就好好期待电影的成品吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
